window.products.push({"id":352079,"name":"Sunnydaze 35.75\" Curved Face Wall Mount or Freestanding Color-Changing Fireplace - Indoor LED Electric Fireplace Heater - Floating or Floor/Tabletop S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":203.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eBZfCI82L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stylish electric fireplace: This modern fireplace measures 35.75\" W x 8.75\" D with stand (4.5\" D when wall mounted) x 21.5\" H with stand (17.5\" H when wall mounted) and weighs 33.4 lbs. The remote measures 3.5\" H x 1.5\" W. The wall mount insert measures 32\" W x 3.5\" D x 14\" H. The base measures 16\" W x 8.75\" D x 0.75\" H. The overall BTU output is 4,777 BTUs, and it has 1,400 W. It requires 11.7 amps and has 120 volts. The cord length is 70\". It provides supplemental heating for up to 377 sq ft. Modern curved design: This elegant fireplace heater features a unique curved face and is made of durable polypropylene with a crystal-clear glass front and black powder-coated finish. Choose between a stylish log bed or pack of decorative crystals or pebbles (all 3 options are included). 2 installation options: This product includes 1 electric indoor fireplace, 1 mounting bracket, 1 remote control (1 CR 2025 3-volt lithium battery included), 1 decorative log bed, 1 package of decorative pebbles, and 1 package of decorative crystals. Choose between wall-mounted installation or attach the included parts to create a freestanding base (2 people are required for both installation methods). A variety of heating and display options: This unit features bottom vent heating that can be turned on or off and temperature limited control for additional safety. Use either the unit buttons or remote control to choose from a variety of heat and display options for the perfect atmosphere. This portable fireplace offers 7 flame color options, 7 ember bed colors, 3 ambient side lighting options, adjustable temperature settings from 62 to 82 degrees Fahrenheit, and a 30-minute to 6-hour timer. Worry-free purchasing: Sunnydaze Decor backs its products with a 1-year manufacturer's warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eBZfCI82L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunnydaze","source_asin":"B09J5BP9R7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-352079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J5BP9R7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J5BP9R7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
