window.products.push({"id":352153,"name":"SafeLand Patented Non-Slip Bath, Shower and Tub Mat, 28x16 Inch, TPR Material, Eco-Friendly, Non-PVC, Machine Washable, Extra-Soft, with Powerful Grip","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716XjKKI-cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"● 100% TPR Material: Our bath and shower mats are made from TPR material which is odorless and harmless to skin, also without any harmful chemicals or toxic factors. Soft and durable better than natural rubber. REACH certified. ● HUNDREDS OF HIGH-STRENGTH SUCTION CUPS: Our bath and shower mats provide strong slip resistance with suctions cups covered on the bottom which help hold in place on smooth and clean surfaces. ● MACHINE WASHABLE: All of our mats are machine-washable. We highly recommend rinsing and drying your bath mat after every use to remove oily and slippery buildup that may occur from various soaps and hair products. And wash your mat at least twice a month by simply throwing the mat in your washing machine on cold with gentle detergent (no bleach) and air dry. Please refrain from direct sun light. ● MADE FOR SAFETY AND COMFORT: This durable bath and shower mat stands up to repeated daily use. You will be surprised at its softness and strong grip. WARNING!! Secure the mat and suction cups before each use. Do not use bath oils!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716XjKKI-cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Safeland","source_asin":"B07MH4QT82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-352153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MH4QT82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MH4QT82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":352154,"name":"20 Piece Matte Black Silverware Set,Stainless Steel Flatware Cutlery Set Service for 4,Kitchen Tableware Set,Utensil Set for Home and Restaurant,Knive","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71htkFk1cBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍽【20 PIECES BLACK SILVERWARE SET FOR 4】: This black silverware set comes with 4 Dinner Forks, 4 Dinner Spoons, 4 Dinner Knife, 4 Salad/Dessert Fork and 4 Dessert/Tea Spoons, essential for families or restaurants. The set is also an irreplaceable dining tool whether it is for daily use or for preparing dinners or parties. 🍽【PREMIUM STAINLESS STEEL】: This flatware set is made of high quality food grade stainless steel which is very durable, rust-proof, corrosion resistant, non-toxic, BPA free, no metal aftertaste. Meanwhile, its sturdiness ensures that it will not bend easily providing you with long - term use. 🍽【UNIQUE MATTE BLACK LOOK】: The mysterious matte black appearance stands out from ordinary silverware, making it look more retro and vintage, just like a noble flatware used in the manor, smooth surface and fine workmanship make it more luxurious and create an elegant, noble and luxurious dining atmosphere. There is no need to worry about fading or cracking, as this is a metal layer from vacuum plating technology. If you want to be different in tableware, you won’t miss it. 🍽【PROPER WEIGHT AND ERGONOMIC HANDLE】: Unlike other brands, the curvature of our utensil handles is designed according to the posture of the hand, and the appropriate weight and perfect balance are added to ensure maximum comfort during use that avoids you feel tired. Moreover, the smooth edges ensure safety and no scratches. 🍽【USE AND CARE】: It is recommended to wash by hand, wipe dry before storing. Do not use wire brushes, hard sponges or clean cloths and other hard materials cleaning tools to avoid damage the silverware. 🍽【LIFETIME SUPPORT】: If you have any questions about our silverware set, please contact us and we will solve it for you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71htkFk1cBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUTNITT","source_asin":"B0BXHZD3QQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-352154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXHZD3QQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXHZD3QQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
