window.products.push({"id":352398,"name":"Propik Christmas Wreath Storage Bag 24\" - Garland Holiday Container with Clear Window - Tear Resistant Fabric - 2 Pack (24 Inch, Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SKhtQBcrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Each wreath storage bag measure 24” X 24” X 8” making them just the right size for the storing of standard artificial door wreaths. These wreath storage bags protect your seasonal wreaths so you can use them again and again – year after year. The attached handles make the bags super easy to carry. Our xmas wreath storage bags are made out of a premium tear resistant plastic material Grab a storage bag for each of your foam wreaths, vine wreaths and ornament wreaths! We are confident that you will enjoy the benefits provided by these bag Organizer, which is why we offer a 100% MONEY-BACK GUARANTEE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SKhtQBcrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ProPik","source_asin":"B0BKDQ8575","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-352398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKDQ8575","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKDQ8575","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":352399,"name":"Beachbum Berry's Navy Grog Cone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d9gRMKvrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In order to make the signature ice cone garnish for the Navy Grog you need Beachbum Berry's Navy Grog Cone 2 piece kit, metal cone mold and rod. Tightly pack the metal mold with finely shaved \"snow\" ice. You can make snow ice by running crushed ice through a food processor or a Sno-Cone maker. Next, run the poking rod through the center to make a hole for the straw. Then gently remove your ice cone from the metal mold, and place the ice cone upright in your freezer. Let cone freeze for a minimum of 4 hours, until it's frozen solid. When ready to use, remove the hardened cone from the freezer and slide a straw through the hole.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d9gRMKvrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cocktail Kingdom","source_asin":"B00P85C9IS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-352399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P85C9IS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P85C9IS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":352400,"name":"Stiio White Voile Curtains 4 Panels, Semi-Transparent Window Sheer Curtain Drapes Rod Pocket for Light Filtering Style Net Sheer for Bedroom Living Ro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D0N82GvyS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rod Pocket Voile Curtains: 2 panels sheer curtains per package. Each panel measures 52”W x 63”L with pocket diameter 1.5 inch (3.8cm) to fit most standard curtain rods, just slide through to install. Can be hung separately, or a perfect match with any blackout curtains to add a fresh, airy, and vibrant look to your home. Sheer White Curtains Design: Stiio sheer voile curtain panels feature vertical line weave, which is different from other curtains, making your ceiling look higher. Linen texture gauze curtains filters harsh sunlight, and balance the light level between indoor and outdoor, let you enjoy beautiful scenery without being pried on from outside, creating a private but bright ambience. 100% Quality Polyester Fabric: The sheer privacy curtains is thin, lightweight but also strong enough. The white sheer window curtains perfect for summer with good insulation and UV light blocking performance. Soft looking white semi sheer panel is fresh looking with a nice drape. Classic white fits into any style home decoration in kitchen, bedroom, study, kids room, dining room. Choosing the Size: Measure your window and rod before ordering. The curtain rod diameter shall not be larger 1.5 inch. Each curtain panel is 52 inch wide, choose as needed. We recommend you put on curtains that are 2 times wider than the window to create full layered look. Easy to Care & Lifetime Warranty: Stiio sheer curtains hang with a nice drape, easy and convenient to daily care. Machine washable, Air dry, Do not bleach, Iron on low heat when necessary. We offer lifetime warranty against product defects, if you have any problems about the product, please feel free contact us, we will be at your side 7/24 to address your concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D0N82GvyS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stiio","source_asin":"B08Z3YQYB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-352400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z3YQYB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z3YQYB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
