window.products.push({"id":352518,"name":"Hannah Silk 1 Pair Standard Pure Mulberry Silk Pillowcase. 100% Pure Mulberry. Cares for Your Hair and Complexion. Standard Size (20x26). Envelope Clo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EtAqpTlJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our silk pillow case made of 100% high quality grade 22MM mulberry silk- one of smoothest, creamiest, and shiniest type of silk. Valuable beauty and self care tool for everyone: Silk is ultra breathable and hypo-allergenic. It has a smooth and slightly soft surface creating a soft sleep where skin and hair experience less friction. This is believed to reduce wrinkles and prevent hair breakage and matting. When you wake up after sleeping on silk pillowcases, your face will be better hydrated and also benefit those with dry peeling skin. It also contains natural cellular albumen which speeds up the metabolism of skin cells, thus delaying the aging process. You will wake up each morning with healthy skin and beautiful hair. Perfect for decorating bedrooms: Your home and bedroom style will also benefit from a set of ultra sensual and luxurious silk pillowcases. We offer a fabulous selection of colors, from soft tones to bright tones of color, you're sure to find a silk pillowcase that complements your decor. Ergonomic design: Classic envelope closure at the side without flange, pillow can be easily put into the pillowcase, better fit and comfortable to sleep, no zipper and avoid hair stuck, support long-term usage. The classic envelope closure design makes it easier to fit in pillow and has longer durability comparing to a zipper design. Keep warm your body , comfortable temperature: Pure silk is a breathable fabric. It is a good temperature regulator, helping the body retain heat in cold weather and excess heat is expelled in warm weather. Easy care & Durable: Silk is a strong fiber and can be hand-washed or washed on a delicate cycle in a laundry machine and hung or laid flat to dry. Dyes love to be washed with a neutral, biodegradable soap. We recommend that you wash before using and ironing right after a easy wash or creases heavily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EtAqpTlJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HANNAH SILK","source_asin":"B0887Z6K3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-352518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0887Z6K3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0887Z6K3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
