window.products.push({"id":352676,"name":"Expandable, Lockable, Slip-Resistant, Extra Deep, 100% Bamboo: The Only Drawer Organizer with All-in-1 Features | Use in Kitchen, Bedroom, Bathroom or","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614lVvs7UiL._AC_SL1061_.jpg","description":"Bring elite design into your home with the extra-deep bamboo drawer organizer tray, featuring expandable locking compartments and a nonslip base. Prepare to simplify your drawer setup in style. Unlike other organizer trays, our premium Moso bamboo organizer offers a stylish and innovative solution to drawer clutter in a customizable design and MDF-free finish. Its naturally water-resistant properties and durability make bamboo a wise choice over plastic organizers that scuff and scratch easily. Our innovative design fuses modular customization with nonslip features to keep your tray in place. Elegant Minimalist Design This hyper-functional design contains two expandable trays on either side to increase your storage capacity with up to eight (8) compartments. To install, fully extend the sides and lock into place, then set your tray into the destination drawer. For smaller spaces, either leave the sides closed or open partially for an equally sleek appearance. Additional features include: Non-slip silicone pads secure the tray Extra-deep 2.75-inch rise (internal height up to 2.4”) Measures 18” inches front to back (Please measure your drawer carefully before ordering to avoid disappointment.) Adjustable width range of 12.5”- 19.3” inches Water-resistant for easy washing by hand Beautiful box, ideal for a gift Say goodbye to drawer clutter and wasted space with a storage solution that’s designed to last. Its adaptable sizing means you can customize your tray to fit in different drawers for seasonal cleaning or big moves. No matter where you use it—in the kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, workshop, or office—this multipurpose organizing tool keeps your drawers in order. Complete with elegant packaging and superior features it is perfect for gifting. Give the gift of simple, elegant home solutions or pick up your very own drawer organizer today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614lVvs7UiL._AC_SL1061_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pristine Bamboo","source_asin":"B01LYHDE3J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-352676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LYHDE3J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LYHDE3J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
