window.products.push({"id":352687,"name":"LAWOHO Christmas Tree Topper Star, 10-inch Rustic Brown Rattan Natural with 10 Warm White Lights Three Functions with Timer, Seasonal Decoration for F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WPP2fR-YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Rustic Christmas Tree Decoration】The tree topper star is hand-woven from natural rattan.It is simple and elegant, with a rustic flavor.It looks very natural on the Christmas tree, blends with the entire rustic Christmas tree decoration, and illuminates your home with its unique and soft lights. 【Product Structure and Features】The size is 11.8 x 10 inch/30 x 25.5 cm, compatible with most Christmas trees; traditional 5-point star design, more festive atmosphere; 10 LED lights, bright and rustic; spring base is more stable, easy to install,and the color is in harmony with the rattan. 【Unique Timer Function】Put 3xAA batteries into the battery case (not included).OFF:Close mode;NO:Constant light mode(Need to be closed manually);Timer:Stay lit for 6 hours then shuts down for 18 hours, automatic cyclic timing function until battery energy disappears.Reduce the load on the battery and LED lights, which is safe and worry-free.We do not need to operate every day,the light automatically turns on and off. 【Suitable for Multiple Scenarios】The brown rattan natural tree topper star is a great way to decorate any size tree for the Christmas.It can be used to decorate Christmas trees in homes, shops, bars, offices,restaurant;It can also be applied to many Christmas themes, such as country decoration themes, retro decoration themes, farmhouse decoration themes, beach themes,coastal themes and so on. 【After-sales Service】After receiving the goods, if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. We will do our best to get you a satisfactory answer within 24 hours. I sincerely hope that you and your family will spend a beautiful and warm Christmas!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WPP2fR-YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAWOHO","source_asin":"B099MTDSFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-352687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099MTDSFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099MTDSFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
