window.products.push({"id":352764,"name":"Viking Hybrid Plus All-in-1 Pan, 10 inch, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pf0IY+CIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Viking Hybrid Plus Tri-Ply Nonstick Fry Pans are the signature choice for all your searing, sautéing, and browning needs in your kitchen and cleans easily. The 10” Pan in particular is an ideal fit for any usage no matter how big your house is. Viking Hybrid Plus cookware is coated with Whitford QuanTanium, an advanced nonstick coating featuring long lasting, superior release and made without PFOA. Sitting above the nonstick coating is the innovative raised stainless steel honeycomb pattern that is makes your pan perfectly compatible with metal utensils without any scratching. Never again will you or anyone in your house ever has to worry about what utensil you should use for these scratch-resistance nonstick pans. The 3-ply stainless steel clad assembly ensures professional quality heat transfer. The exterior layer is induction capable while the interior layer is 18/8 non-reactive surgical grade steel. Within these two layers is an aluminum layer that helps with even heat conduction through the bottom and walls of the wall. This three-layer construction makes for more efficient cooking. Finally, the pan features rolled rims for drip-free pouring. Viking’s signature ergonomic handles are riveted in place and fully cast stainless for lifetime usage. Each handle stays cool during use with a heat break and a finger guide to make a lifting and control easier for you. Because of the hybrid construction, liquid foods like eggs might be more likely to stick. Best recommendation is to use oil or butter with these foods. In addition, lower heat and letting such foods solidify before flipping can yield better results. For the best release, it is recommended to cook on low to medium heat. NEVER use aerosol nonstick sprays with these pans as it will reduce the life of the nonstick coating. The Viking 3-Ply Hybrid Plus line also includes a 12” fry pan and a 5. 7 Qt. Everyday Pan that is great for stir fry and larger dishes. Hybrid Plus pans are dishwasher safe but hand washing is recommended to ensure the cookware lasts as long as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pf0IY+CIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viking Culinary","source_asin":"B081ZRR3SL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-352764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081ZRR3SL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081ZRR3SL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
